<p>Dear <%= @resource.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</p>

<p>
  Thanks for signing up to Mezzanine. Use this code to confirm your email address:
</p>

<p style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= @token %>
</p>

<p>
  This code expires in 2 days. If you didn’t create an account, you can ignore this email.
</p>

<p>
  Kind regards,<br>
  The Mezzanine team<br>
  <%= mail_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %>
</p>
